4. a stationary seasonal series read by year windows and by 120-tick windows
   amp = seasonal swing +-amp bp; pairs = successive windows; 'grow' = range above the previous by more than
   s05.range_growth_bp (1 000); 'fact' = grows and range above 20 000 (fails STY-P03's two conjuncts);
   'regime' = R6's rule alone (range above 30 000 and growth above 2 500), two in a row
